<title>FINLAND: PARTEK RENAMES SISU TRACTOR OPS VALTRA.</title>
<headline>PARTEK RENAMES SISU TRACTOR OPS VALTRA.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish engineering and building materials group Partek Oy Ab said on Tuesday it had renamed its Sisu Tractors unit Valtra Oy.</p>
<p>&quot;The name Valtra Oy will be introduced in August,&quot; Partek said in a statement.</p>
<p>The unit, which Partek acquired through its merger with Finnish heavy vehicle maker Sisu Oy earlier this year, makes tractors under the Valmet and Valtra brands, Partek said.</p>
<p>&quot;Under the agreement made with Valmet , the Valmet trademark can be used until 2001,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 235, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
